---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import data from '../data/licenses.json';
---

<Layout title="Pricing — FastLicense" description="Transparent pricing for fast-track business licensing. Service fees from $200. Exact quote before you commit.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Pricing</h1>
      <p>Transparent fees. Exact quote before you commit. No surprises.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="pricing-intro" style="max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 40px; text-align: center;">
        <p>Our pricing has two components: our service fee (for preparing and filing your application) and the government filing fee (paid to the state). Both are quoted upfront before you commit to anything.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-table-wrap">
        <table class="pricing-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>License Type</th>
              <th>Our Service Fee</th>
              <th>Gov. Filing Fee</th>
              <th>Fast-Track Timeline</th>
              <th>Bond Required</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {data.types.map(t => (
              <tr>
                <td><a href={`/licenses/${t.id}`}>{t.name}</a></td>
                <td>{t.cost}</td>
                <td>{t.govFee}</td>
                <td>{t.fast}</td>
                <td>{t.bond ? 'Yes' : 'No'}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-notes">
        <h3>What's Included in the Service Fee</h3>
        <div class="included-list">
          <div class="inc">Application preparation and document assembly</div>
          <div class="inc">Regulatory filing and fee payment coordination</div>
          <div class="inc">Status tracking through approval</div>
          <div class="inc">Deficiency response (if the state sends corrections)</div>
          <div class="inc">Surety bond procurement (for licenses that require a bond)</div>
          <div class="inc">Confirmation of approval and license delivery</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-notes">
        <h3>Multi-State Discounts</h3>
        <p>Filing in multiple states? We offer volume discounts. The more states you need, the lower the per-state service fee. <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> for a multi-state quote. Most multi-state clients see 60-80% time savings compared to doing it themselves.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-notes">
        <h3>No Hidden Fees</h3>
        <p>The quote you receive before starting is the price you pay. Government filing fees are passed through at cost with no markup. If a state changes its requirements after we begin, we handle the additional work at no extra charge.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Get Your Exact Quote</h2>
      <p>Use the timeline estimator for an instant estimate, or contact us for a detailed multi-state quote.</p>
      <a href="/#quiz">Get Your Timeline</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark) 0%, #1a2744 50%, var(--dark-mid) 100%);
    padding: 56px 0 48px;
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
  }
  .page-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .page-hero p { color: #94A3B8; font-size: 1.05rem; }

  .pricing-intro p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }

  .pricing-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .pricing-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .pricing-table th {
    background: var(--dark);
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }
  .pricing-table td {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .pricing-table td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
  .pricing-table td a { font-weight: 600; }
  .pricing-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .pricing-table tr:hover td { background: var(--bg); }

  .pricing-notes {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .pricing-notes h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .pricing-notes p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }

  .included-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  .inc {
    padding: 8px 0 8px 22px;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .inc::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .included-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pricing-table { font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .pricing-table th, .pricing-table td { padding: 10px 8px; }
  }
</style>
